{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970070/extras/a097dfec688a2cad3156f69c24c6161d.poster.avif?t=1768479370\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970070/extras/a097dfec688a2cad3156f69c24c6161d.webm?t=1768479370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970070/extras/a097dfec688a2cad3156f69c24c6161d.mp4?t=1768479370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astra: Ardent Show</strong> is a visual novel about a bold and charming furry princess who decides to write her own destiny and completely changed her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970070/extras/ecb7a64efbc2e2f62238840ec87ce9bc.avif?t=1768479370\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astra had it all: a title of heir, a huge, beautiful castle, and a noble husband. But this perfect picture was missing the most important thing: freedom. One day, she abandons everything and escapes to a remote island, where she finds friends and turns her life into a vibrant show by becoming a traveling performer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970070/extras/6c0d2e7e4c8a00cd33aed7ea9dd0b498.avif?t=1768479370\" width=780 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you can't escape the past when the entire kingdom is searching for the missing heir. Marquis Saffron arrives on warships with his loyal soldiers to reclaim his lawful wife, and he won't be stopped by neither persuasion nor weapons. Now Astra must make a choice that will determine not only her own freedom but the fate of two islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970070/extras/a97101d49f4a2a18b496f932224a3861.poster.avif?t=1768479370\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970070/extras/a97101d49f4a2a18b496f932224a3861.webm?t=1768479370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970070/extras/a97101d49f4a2a18b496f932224a3861.mp4?t=1768479370\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel heavily dependent on your choices </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of genitals (furry or vanilla)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot sex animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970070/extras/ecb7a64efbc2e2f62238840ec87ce9bc.avif?t=1768479370\" width=780 height=64 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970070?t=1768479370","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970070/16822525ae68a0cf83438dbcb33d1b6b4